2. Microservices Application
-------------------------------------------------------------
The Enterprise large-scale application that comprises of several modules/functionalities are broken down into smaller microservices applications based on few characteristics
1. Loosely coupled
2. independently deployable
3. highly scalable
4. highly available
5. resilient
6. collaborative services
that can be developed by multiple independent parallel collaborating teams.
